[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494139442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99536#issuecomment-2494139442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99536","id":2494139442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UqYwy","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T16:20:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T16:23:40Z","body":"Taking out of draft as although I intended to also look at GLES2, it doesn't have to be same PR, and this PR is fairly simple and will do as a stop gap in case we decide to make bigger changes.\r\n\r\nWill be interested in @clayjohn 's opinion here before going further, and it would be good if @sabudum could test the artifacts here to see whether it fixes their issue on their hardware. \r\n\r\nI was also wondering about casting `shadow_split_offset.w` to `mediump` but just checked and it is `mediump` already so should be good for mobile.\r\n\r\nIf this *is* down to running out of uniform register storage, even if it is blowing a regular number like 512 bytes, this may be project dependent because this would depend on which particular `#defines` were defined for the shader at which point the penalty was paid.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494139442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494512186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99536#issuecomment-2494512186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99536","id":2494512186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Urzw6","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T18:39:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T18:39:49Z","body":"This makes sense to me. It aligns with my theory that this portion of the shader is heavily load/store bound (just like in 4.x). Accordingly, each additional load/store will make a big impact.\r\n\r\nI have a feeling that the previous code resulted in a full vec4 load operation while this one gets optimized to a single float load on your hardware. GPUs prefer to load 4 floats at a time (a matrix load is 4 operations for example), but I suspect there is a fast path when you are only loading 1. That's just a theory though, I haven't looked at the disassembly. \r\n\r\nI don't think this would be a register issue because the number of registers will stay the same (instead of loading `fade_to` and storing it in a register you keep `shadow_split_offsets` around and waste a register).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494512186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495391697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99536#issuecomment-2495391697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99536","id":2495391697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UvKfR","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T08:04:14Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T08:04:14Z","body":"We can probably try and do some further work on this area, especially testing on mobile, but this PR will likely be helpful on at least some hardware, if it does not solve the regression on all, so makes sense to merge for now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495391697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495391762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99536#issuecomment-2495391762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99536","id":2495391762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UvKgS","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T08:04:27Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T08:04:27Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER",